---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { Code } from 'astro:components';

const pageTitle = "Accessibility - Thamara Kandabada";
const slashpageImage = "/featured-images/accessibility.png";
---
<PageLayout title={pageTitle} image={slashpageImage}>
  
    <h1>Accessibility Notice</h1>

    <div class="accessibility-version-notice">
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Statement Version:</strong> <Code code=`2.0.0` inline /></li>
        <li><strong>Last Updated:</strong> 31 Aug 2026</li>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/thamarakandabada/personal-website/commits/main/src/pages/accessibility.astro" target="_blank">View previous versions</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <p>This is an accessibility statement for the website <span class="basic-information website-name">Thamara Kandabada</span>. The contents of this statement apply to the domain <Code code=`thamara.co.uk` inline />.</p>

    <h2>Conformance status</h2>
    
    <p>
	The <a href="https://www.w3.org/WAI/standards-guidelines/wcag/">Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG)</a> define requirements for designers and developers to improve accessibility for people with disabilities. It defines three levels of conformance: Level A, Level AA, and Level AAA. <span class="basic-information website-name">Thamara Kandabada</span> is <span class="basic-information conformance-status" data-printfilter="lowercase"><strong>partially conformant</strong></span> with
	<span class="basic-information conformance-standard"><span data-negate="">WCAG 2.2 level AA</span> with a commitment to achieve full conformance by routinely evaluating and reviewing the design of this site.</span><span><span class="basic-information conformance-status"> Full conformance</span> means that <span class="basic-information conformance-meaning">the content fully conforms to the accessibility standard without any exceptions</span>.
    </span>
    </p>

  <h2>Feedback</h2>
  <p>I welcome your feedback on the accessibility of this website. Please let me know if you encounter any accessibility barriers or have suggestions for improvement. You can contact me by <span class="basic-information feedback h-card">e-mail</span> at <a class="email u-email" href="mailto:t@thamara.co.uk">t@thamara.co.uk</a></p>

  <p>This statement was created on <span class="basic-information statement-created-date">6 June 2026</span> using the <a href="https://www.w3.org/WAI/planning/statements/">W3C Accessibility Statement Generator Tool</a>.</p>

  <h2>Versioning</h2>
  <p>I use the following method of semantic versioning for this policy: <Code code=`Major.Minor.Stylistic` inline /></p>
  
</PageLayout>